{"steam_appid":1489630,"steam_name":"Carrier Command 2","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1489630/391181/0faf035134f61a3301d3ae7fcf2ed27aee42f750/1750694234/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1628611268","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256845992/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1628611268","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1489630/ss_d845b3386160d5ea89accfeebe4a8cbe4fe7f6df.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772367494","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1489630/ss_c7f530a91861ae18f45fcee10a1c1b9ede390b9f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772367494","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1489630/ss_a5802907e9d7dab4acfc271d63934f07b10c1136.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772367494","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1489630/ss_5e9a0fc599e507c1a74d35664a93fb5143885b4a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772367494","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1489630/ss_7b84e701fb3f414daef8697160465f5f839712e6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772367494"],"about_the_game":"Note: This game can be played in non-virtual reality mode, and also in virtual reality.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1489630/extras/59b4d4605c2ac7443096d3ab683b94ca.poster.avif?t=1772367494\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1489630/extras/59b4d4605c2ac7443096d3ab683b94ca.webm?t=1772367494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1489630/extras/59b4d4605c2ac7443096d3ab683b94ca.mp4?t=1772367494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Carrier Command 2 is Strategy, Planning and Teamwork on a scale that is both engaging and manageable. True to MicroProse's heritage, Carrier Command 2 is all about meaningful decisions.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Command and Control</h2></strong>Take command of a carrier and operate its systems to launch your offensive and conquer the Archipelago. Get in the shoes of an admiral and lead from the front.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1489630/extras/145e219123d91df647a19e3e2df9619b.poster.avif?t=1772367494\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1489630/extras/145e219123d91df647a19e3e2df9619b.webm?t=1772367494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1489630/extras/145e219123d91df647a19e3e2df9619b.mp4?t=1772367494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategize</h2></strong>Gather intel from your vehicles’ radars, pick your tools of the trade, and launch your attacks where the enemy presence is thinner. The approach you take to a situation will play a big part in the outcome.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1489630/extras/bf25eaa11eee85bb169346a3dc89baf0.poster.avif?t=1772367494\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1489630/extras/bf25eaa11eee85bb169346a3dc89baf0.webm?t=1772367494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1489630/extras/bf25eaa11eee85bb169346a3dc89baf0.mp4?t=1772367494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Plan</h2></strong>Once you have taken an island you will need to exploit and defend the resources it provides. Ensuring these supply lines remain open will be key to your survival. Think ahead.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1489630/extras/be0143714af055b7c50d8e8432779b62.poster.avif?t=1772367494\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1489630/extras/be0143714af055b7c50d8e8432779b62.webm?t=1772367494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1489630/extras/be0143714af055b7c50d8e8432779b62.mp4?t=1772367494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Teamwork</h2></strong>Make the most of different unit types synergies and create combined arms assaults to efficiently win battles. On top of that, get into each and every vehicle and take part in the action!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1489630/extras/268e668dfd8604b2c946868d818a96cd.poster.avif?t=1772367494\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1489630/extras/268e668dfd8604b2c946868d818a96cd.webm?t=1772367494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1489630/extras/268e668dfd8604b2c946868d818a96cd.mp4?t=1772367494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An illustrious heritage</h2></strong>Carrier Command is an ’80s strategy classic well known for its unique blend of strategy and vehicle simulation. The legend is back!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1489630/extras/6e3ef5f636fda02bb8d7a1911b02b8a3.avif?t=1772367494\" width=616 height=346 /></span>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 / 8 / 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4440 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD 6000 / GeForce 550 / AMD R7 250 (AMD Radeon HD 7750)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> SteamVR</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 / 8 / 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6440 / Ryzen 5 2400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce 870 Ti / AMD RX 550<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure","Simulation","Strategy"],"developers":["Geometa"],"publishers":["MicroProse Software"],"release_date":"Aug 10, 2021"}